        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of early-onset neurological symptoms, characteristic MRI hypomyelination pattern, and confirmed biallelic pathogenic RARS mutations",
    "notes": "Diagnosis relies heavily on genetic confirmation due to overlapping clinical and imaging features with other leukodystrophies."
